    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44599" root="&#xA;                        وشى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشَى</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشْىٌ</span>, <i>He variegated,</i> or
<i>figured,</i> a piece of cloth, or a garment; (Mgh,
Msb, * K;) and <i>embellished it.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشَى</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ إِلَى السُّلْطَانِ</span>, (S, K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِنْدَ السُّلْطَانِ</span>, (Msb,)
<i>He calumniated,</i> or <i>misrepresented, him to the
Sultán.</i> (S, Msb, K.)

